WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.208
<v Narrator>I open Homework Helper.

2
00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.009
<v Tutor>Hi there! I am your Homework Helper,

3
00:00:06.009 --> 00:00:08.094
<v Tutor>and I am so excited to work with you.

4
00:00:08.094 --> 00:00:11.475
<v Tutor>Whenever you are ready, you can upload a photo of a problem,

5
00:00:11.475 --> 00:00:14.406
<v Tutor>draw it, or just type it out right here in the chat.

6
00:00:14.406 --> 00:00:16.040
<v Tutor>What are we working on today?

7
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.175
<v Narrator>I type a math question and send it.

8
00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:28.679
<v Tutor>That is a great question to start with.

9
00:00:28.679 --> 00:00:31.085
<v Tutor>To check if a solution is correct,

10
00:00:31.085 --> 00:00:34.906
<v Tutor>you can plug the value back into the original equation

11
00:00:34.906 --> 00:00:37.595
<v Tutor>to see if both sides equal each other.

12
00:00:37.595 --> 00:00:41.203
<v Tutor>If we replace x with 5 in the equation 3x + 5 = 20,

13
00:00:41.203 --> 00:00:42.901
<v Tutor>we get 3 times 5 plus 5.

14
00:00:42.901 --> 00:00:45.378
<v Tutor>That equals 15 plus 5, which is 20.

15
00:00:45.378 --> 00:00:48.400
<v Tutor>Since 20 equals 20, your answer is correct.

16
00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:54.440
<v Narrator>Now I upload a science homework question.

17
00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:58.312
<v Narrator>I ask for a short explanation.

18
00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:11.104
<v Tutor>The ice cube will float because its density

19
00:01:11.104 --> 00:01:13.638
<v Tutor>is less than that of liquid water.

20
00:01:13.638 --> 00:01:16.693
<v Tutor>Since the ice has a density of 0.92 g/cm³

21
00:01:16.693 --> 00:01:19.301
<v Tutor>compared to the water's 1.00 g/cm³,

22
00:01:19.301 --> 00:01:22.560
<v Tutor>it is buoyant enough to stay on the surface.

23
00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:25.257
<v Narrator>I review the answer.
